or the Contracted Business Purpose;')], [Span('5.3.3.', bold: true), Span(' Company may de-identify or aggregate Customer Data as part of performing the services specified in the Terms.')], [Span('5.3.4.', bold: true), Span(' Company will limit personal information collection, use, retention, and disclosure to activities reasonably necessary and proportionate to achieve the Contracted Business Purposes or another compatible operational purpose.')]]),
