t Module II – “Controller to Processor”, of the Standard Contractual Clauses, with modifications detailed under this Section 11.3.2. However, when Customer is acting as a processor Module III (“Processor-to-Processor”) shall apply, provided that, taking into account the nature of the processing, Customer agrees that it is unlikely that Company will know the identity of Customer’s controllers, as Company has no direct relationship with Customer’s controllers and therefore, Customer will fulfil Company’s obligations to Customer’s controllers under the Processor-to-Processor SCCs.')], [Span('11.3.2.', bold: true), Span(' The parties are deemed to have accepted and executed the SCCs, including the associated annexes. The contents of Annex I of the SCCs are included within Appendix A to this DPA. The contents of Annex II of the SCCs are included within Appendix B to this DPA. The parties further agree to the following implementation choices under the SCCs:')], [Span('11.3.2.1.', bold: true), Span(' Clause 7: shall not be applicable.')], [Span('11.3.2.2.', bold: true), Span(' Clause 9(a): The parties choose Option 2, “General Written Authorization” and specify a time period of thirty (30) days.')], [Span('11.3.2.3.', bold: true), Span(' Clause 11: The parties choose not to include the optional language relating to the use of an independent dispute resolution body.')], [Span('11.3.2.4.', bold: true), Span(' Clause 17: The parties select Option 1 and specify the law of [Governing Law State/Country].')], [Span('11.3.2.5.', bold: true), Span(' Clause 18(b): The parties specify the courts of [City/Jurisdiction].')], [Span('11.3.3.', bold: true), Span(' In the case of transfer of Personal Data between Company and its Sub-Processors for the purposes of carrying out specific Processing activities (on behalf of Customer) the Parties will enter into Module III (“Processor-to-Processor”) of the Standard Contractual Clauses.')], [Span('11.4.', bold: true), Span(' Appendixes A and B, attached to this DPA shall also apply in connection with the processing of Personal Data, subject to Applicable Data Protection Law.')], [Span('11.5.', bold: true), Span(' Company reserves the right to adopt an alternative compliance standard to the SCCs for the lawful transfer of Personal Data, provided it is recognized under Data Protection Law. Company will provide 30 days’ advance notice of its adoption of an alternative compliance standard.')]]),
